    "description": {
      "content": "The AppSamurai Campaign Spend API lets customers retrieve their campaign spend data with a single authenticated GET request. Results can be filtered by date range, campaign, application bundle, platform, campaign name, and country. Faithfully modeled by API Evangelist from AppSamurai's published Help Center documentation; not an AppSamurai-published specification.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: AppSamurai Support",
